#: 9fd4e93df48849ec9fca7b17dd961fb5 aae5268b443749838e414c03bbafd903
msgid ""
"``Roll`` is the \"roll factor\" of the motor and functions as an X "
"coordinate for the diagram. Positive is below the origin, and negative is "
"above. Generally, use values between -0.5 and 0.5."
msgstr "``Roll`` 是电机的「横滚因子」，在图中用作 X 坐标。正值在原点下方，负值在原点上方。通常使用 -0.5 至 0.5 之间的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:121
#: 010cec5a70c04a4a92ea5fc5121d9bc5 11079ccee91b48c8b7ba2a0b35051514
#: 131e28fb1d304167ac8e204465989868 1b34d20e99214c0387c0abbd1a3153d4
#: 66c38477ef5f4135ab550aac1d3bb919 6c272be2da7841ce80395c48d7b5a102
#: 7184f31ec6094a32ae9ed8b132aa6a13 81c7c8921ec04135aa21294ba049f626
#: a01ba96c160a4f80b0eac65004df22a8 c643eec944f742e98a02b6fba4a4cf2f
#: d19f57a705a645c1a8d584cafc46cbec e14654d9ca064bc193fa04982b5395b9
msgid ""
"``Pitch`` is the \"pitch factor\" of the motor and functions as a Y "
"coordinate for the diagram. Positive is to the right, and negative is to the"
" left. Generally, use values between -0.5 and 0.5."
msgstr "``Pitch`` 是电机的「俯仰因子」，在图中用作 Y 坐标。正值在右侧，负值在左侧。通常使用 -0.5 至 0.5 之间的值。"

